# kiln-platform's messages.

## When the platform's open panel fails.

kiln-platform-open-panel-unavailable = The open panel isn't available
# On Linux, where the panel is xdg-desktop-portal's: `$error` is why it
# failed, as the portal said.
kiln-platform-open-panel-failed-linux =
    { $error }

    The open panel comes from xdg-desktop-portal: install it with a backend for your desktop, such as xdg-desktop-portal-gtk.
